    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAs">II As</ref> 1.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gif hit hwa do, forgylde ðone þeof be his were—⁊ ne beo þam þeofe no ðe geþingodre—oþþe hine be þam geladie.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if anyone does spare such a thief, he shall either pay for him to the amount of his wergeld—though in that case the thief shall not be any the less liable to punishment—or clear himself [of the accusation] by an oath of equivalent value.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gyf hit hwá dó, forgylde ðone ðeof be his were—⁊ ne beo ðam ðeofe na ðe geðingodre—oððe hine be ðam geladige.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
